    "body": "## What\n- Raise the dev-extra `nvidia-modelopt[torch]` minimum from 0.44 to 0.47.\n- Rebase onto main, preserving its dependency updates.\n- Regenerate `uv.lock`; main already locks ModelOpt 0.47.0. No package versions or sources change. uv normalizes Torch dependency markers.\n\nThe LTS dependency lane is unchanged.\n\n## Validation\n- `uv lock` and `uv lock --check --offline` with uv 0.7.2 in the Megatron-LM CI dev container (`TMS_CUDA_MAJOR=13`).\n- Verify locked package versions and sources match main.\n- `git diff --check origin/main`.\n- No local GPU tests run; CI pending.\n\nUpdated by Chad's Agent.\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
